# NeoBram Testing

When the user requests testing, load the relevant canonical skill from `skills/` and follow it completely. Use `skills/testing-orchestrator/SKILL.md` for multi-category requests. Use the repository CLI when execution is needed:

```bash
node cli/neobram-test.mjs validate
node cli/neobram-test.mjs analyze --project .
```

Do not claim runtime test results unless a command actually ran. Preserve PASS, FAIL, BLOCKED, NOT_RUN, and INCONCLUSIVE distinctions. Do not expose secrets or modify product code without authorization.
